Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:03:33.10,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 辛辛那提 WTA1000 1/8决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:03:33.10,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}斯瓦泰克 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}6-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}3 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}6-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}3{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 帕里 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.24,0:00:01.36,EN,,0,0,0,,the job done.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.24,0:00:01.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,拿下了比赛。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.36,0:00:03.60,EN,,0,0,0,,Three and three in an hour and a half.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.36,0:00:03.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,三比三，一小时二十八分。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.60,0:00:05.60,EN,,0,0,0,,Just a few seconds shy of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.60,0:00:05.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,只差了几秒钟。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.60,0:00:08.48,EN,,0,0,0,,and into the quarterfinals at Cincy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.60,0:00:08.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,已连续第四年打到这一轮，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.48,0:00:11.28,EN,,0,0,0,,for a fourth successive time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.48,0:00:11.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.28,0:00:12.56,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, she knows
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.28,0:00:12.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,她知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.56,0:00:14.56,EN,,0,0,0,,that she's had to battle a couple of times,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.56,0:00:14.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,自己也苦战过几次，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.56,0:00:16.80,EN,,0,0,0,,but that's the strongest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.56,0:00:16.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,但今天是她状态最强的一场。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.80,0:00:19.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Iga, congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.80,0:00:19.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,Iga，恭喜你。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.28,0:00:21.76,EN,,0,0,0,,Man, it is so fun to watch you play.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.28,0:00:21.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,看你打球真的太享受了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.76,0:00:22.80,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, your movement,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.76,0:00:22.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,你的移动、
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.80,0:00:24.32,EN,,0,0,0,,your commitment to your shots,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.80,0:00:24.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,你对每一拍的投入、
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.32,0:00:26.32,EN,,0,0,0,,your intensity, your focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.32,0:00:26.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,你的强度和专注度。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.32,0:00:29.12,EN,,0,0,0,,What were you most happy with today?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.32,0:00:29.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天你对哪一点最满意？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.12,0:00:31.68,EN,,0,0,0,,I think that I was solid,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.12,0:00:31.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得今天打得很稳，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.68,0:00:33.84,EN,,0,0,0,,you know, and even though I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.68,0:00:33.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且即便如此，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.84,0:00:35.60,EN,,0,0,0,,had to put more energy into the ball
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.84,0:00:35.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,我还是要在球上多花力气，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.60,0:00:38.64,EN,,0,0,0,,because she was playing many slices,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.60,0:00:38.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为她打了很多切削球，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.64,0:00:40.24,EN,,0,0,0,,sometimes short, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.64,0:00:40.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,有时候很短，你知道，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.24,0:00:41.44,EN,,0,0,0,,sometimes like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.24,0:00:41.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,有时候又是那种。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.44,0:00:44.16,EN,,0,0,0,,So, I needed to really put a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.44,0:00:44.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我真的需要
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.16,0:00:46.40,EN,,0,0,0,,of effort to be intense
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.16,0:00:46.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,多花些力气去保持强度，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.40,0:00:48.08,EN,,0,0,0,,and I'm happy about that because I did it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.40,0:00:48.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一点我很满意，我从头到尾
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.08,0:00:49.20,EN,,0,0,0,,from the beginning till the end
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.08,0:00:49.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,都做到了这一点，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.20,0:00:51.84,EN,,0,0,0,,and I'm happy with how I was, how precise I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.20,0:00:51.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且我对自己那些球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.84,0:00:53.76,EN,,0,0,0,,was with these shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.84,0:00:53.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,打得多精准也很满意。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.76,0:00:56.40,EN,,0,0,0,,You are such a student of of the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.76,0:00:56.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,你真是这项运动的用功学生。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.40,0:00:57.52,EN,,0,0,0,,So, when I tell you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.40,0:00:57.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我要告诉你，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.52,0:01:00.64,EN,,0,0,0,,this is your 30th WTA 1000 quarterfinal,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.52,0:01:00.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是第三十次打到这一轮，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.64,0:01:03.52,EN,,0,0,0,,it's your fourth straight here in Cincinnati,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.64,0:01:03.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,辛辛那提已经连续第四年了，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.52,0:01:06.16,EN,,0,0,0,,are those are those milestones
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.52,0:01:06.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,这些算是你会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.16,0:01:08.08,EN,,0,0,0,,that you pay any attention to?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.16,0:01:08.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,留意的里程碑吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.08,0:01:09.60,EN,,0,0,0,,Are you aware of those things?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.08,0:01:09.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,你会关注这些数字吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.60,0:01:10.48,EN,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.60,0:01:10.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,不太会。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.48,0:01:12.72,EN,,0,0,0,,It's always nice to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.48,0:01:12.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,听到总是会高兴的。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.72,0:01:14.32,EN,,0,0,0,,Usually after the tournament, I like
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.72,0:01:14.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,通常赛事结束之后，我会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.32,0:01:16.48,EN,,0,0,0,,to maybe a little bit look at the numbers,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.32,0:01:16.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,多少去看一眼那些数字，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.48,0:01:18.48,EN,,0,0,0,,but during I'm just focused
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.48,0:01:18.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,但比赛期间我只专注
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.48,0:01:19.28,EN,,0,0,0,,on the next match.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.48,0:01:19.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,在下一场球上。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.28,0:01:21.52,EN,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if it's a quarterfinal
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.28,0:01:21.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,不管是这一轮还是第二轮，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.52,0:01:22.80,EN,,0,0,0,,or a second round, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.52,0:01:22.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,都一样，你知道，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.80,0:01:25.84,EN,,0,0,0,,I want to I treat every match the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.80,0:01:25.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,每一场我都想用同样态度打。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.84,0:01:29.60,EN,,0,0,0,,So, yeah, but it I I know I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.84,0:01:29.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以，是的，不过我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.60,0:01:31.44,EN,,0,0,0,,my Wikipedia day is going to look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.60,0:01:31.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的维基百科页面会很好看。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.44,0:01:36.00,EN,,0,0,0,,But you know, the key is to focus
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.44,0:01:36.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,但你知道，关键是专注
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.00,0:01:39.20,EN,,0,0,0,,on being present and that's how you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.00,0:01:39.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,在当下，那样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.20,0:01:40.24,EN,,0,0,0,,can get to those numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.20,0:01:40.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,自然就能达到那些数字了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.24,0:01:41.68,EN,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.24,0:01:41.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,你知道，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.68,0:01:43.92,EN,,0,0,0,,Iga, a couple of trivia questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.68,0:01:43.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,Iga，几个花絮问题。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.92,0:01:47.52,EN,,0,0,0,,We all know that you are the Swifty.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.92,0:01:47.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,大家都知道你是霉粉，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.52,0:01:50.24,EN,,0,0,0,,We know you enjoy Legos,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.52,0:01:50.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,也知道你喜欢乐高，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.24,0:01:52.32,EN,,0,0,0,,but now you're getting a master's degree
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.24,0:01:52.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,不管是这一轮还是第二轮，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.32,0:01:56.48,EN,,0,0,0,,in movies from the '9s apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.32,0:01:56.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,在读九十年代电影『硕士』。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.48,0:01:58.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Are you keeping up with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.48,0:01:58.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,你还在跟进吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.72,0:02:01.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Not not no I mean no because I'm I became
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.72,0:02:01.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,不是不是，是因为我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.68,0:02:04.64,EN,,0,0,0,,more you know I'm watching recent
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.68,0:02:04.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,更多是在看，你知道，我在看
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.64,0:02:06.56,EN,,0,0,0,,movies for the first time in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.64,0:02:06.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,近期电影，我人生第一次。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.56,0:02:08.72,EN,,0,0,0,,But I I am a little bit late
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.56,0:02:08.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我确实有点晚了，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.72,0:02:10.72,EN,,0,0,0,,because I just watched Oppenheimer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.72,0:02:10.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为我刚看了《奥本海默》。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.72,0:02:12.48,EN,,0,0,0,,So I loved it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.72,0:02:12.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,我很喜欢。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.48,0:02:14.80,EN,,0,0,0,,I went to the movies to see the Odyssey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.48,0:02:14.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,我去电影院看了《奥德赛》。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.80,0:02:18.48,EN,,0,0,0,,So I'm being a little bit more, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.80,0:02:18.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我这次算是，你知道，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.48,0:02:20.80,EN,,0,0,0,,on on time this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.48,0:02:20.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,跟得上一点了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.80,0:02:23.12,EN,,0,0,0,,But I love '90s movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.80,0:02:23.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我真的很爱九十年代电影。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.12,0:02:25.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Like it had they have their their own vibe
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.12,0:02:25.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,它们自成一种气质，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.28,0:02:27.68,EN,,0,0,0,,and how they shot them,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.28,0:02:27.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,拍摄的方式
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.68,0:02:29.28,EN,,0,0,0,,it was also a bit different.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.68,0:02:29.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,也有点不一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.28,0:02:31.20,EN,,0,0,0,,I don't know. It kind of calms me down
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.28,0:02:31.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,说不上来，就是看着看着
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.20,0:02:31.92,EN,,0,0,0,,to watch them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.20,0:02:31.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,会让我平静下来。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.92,0:02:33.52,EN,,0,0,0,,So yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.92,0:02:33.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.52,0:02:34.72,EN,,0,0,0,,last quick question.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.52,0:02:34.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,最后一个简短的问题。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.72,0:02:36.24,EN,,0,0,0,,My friends and I argue
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.72,0:02:36.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,我和朋友一直在争论
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.24,0:02:37.28,EN,,0,0,0,,about this all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.24,0:02:37.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,这件事。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.28,0:02:40.88,EN,,0,0,0,,As a voracious reader, is listening
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.28,0:02:40.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,作为一个嗜读如命的人，听书
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.88,0:02:44.56,EN,,0,0,0,,to an audio book considered reading
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.88,0:02:44.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,算不算读书，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.56,0:02:46.24,EN,,0,0,0,,to Iga, fanatic?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.56,0:02:46.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,Iga？算吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.24,0:02:48.24,EN,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.24,0:02:48.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,不算。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.24,0:02:49.28,EN,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.24,0:02:49.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,不算。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.28,0:02:50.16,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean reading
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.28,0:02:50.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我是说，读书
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.16,0:02:53.52,EN,,0,0,0,,is literally reading like looking at the letters,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.16,0:02:53.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是真的去看那些字母，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.52,0:02:54.56,EN,,0,0,0,,you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.52,0:02:54.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,你知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.56,0:02:57.36,EN,,0,0,0,,But I've honestly never done
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.56,0:02:57.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,但说实话我从没为了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.36,0:02:58.96,EN,,0,0,0,,that for for my pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.36,0:02:58.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,享受而听过有声书。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.96,0:03:03.60,EN,,0,0,0,,I just used like not audio book but to cheat
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.96,0:03:03.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,我用它只是为了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.60,0:03:05.36,EN,,0,0,0,,in school cuz there were some books
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.60,0:03:05.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,在学校应付一下，因为有些书
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.36,0:03:07.28,EN,,0,0,0,,that I just couldn't read you know I
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.36,0:03:07.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,我真的读不下去，我是说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.28,0:03:11.12,EN,,0,0,0,,mean like two of them only like
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.28,0:03:11.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,就那两本，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.12,0:03:12.72,EN,,0,0,0,,the only books basically I didn't finish
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.12,0:03:12.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,我这辈子基本上没读完的书
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.72,0:03:14.64,EN,,0,0,0,,in my life so I needed to listen to them
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.72,0:03:14.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,就只有那几本，所以我得听，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.64,0:03:16.00,EN,,0,0,0,,because I don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.64,0:03:16.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为你知道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.00,0:03:17.92,EN,,0,0,0,,at school you know you have deadlines I
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.00,0:03:17.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,学校总有交作业的期限，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.92,0:03:19.52,EN,,0,0,0,,was busy playing tennis you know
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.92,0:03:19.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,我那时候又忙着打网球，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.52,0:03:22.56,EN,,0,0,0,,so it saved me quite some time
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.52,0:03:22.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以它帮我省了不少时间，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.56,0:03:25.12,EN,,0,0,0,,but that's the only time I literally listen
